\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Subtype separation versus $\Delta \mathrm  {X}\,R^{2}$ on BRCA. Desirable models sit toward higher separation with clearly positive $\Delta \mathrm  {X}\,R^{2}$. Method~3 occupies the most favourable region among AE-private methods; OMIDIENT's extreme $\Delta $ coincides with private collapse and is not treated as a verified win.}}{32}{figure.caption.31}\protected@file@percent }
